flowchart TD
    subgraph App[app_qt executable - GUI thread]
        Main[ui/src/app/main.cpp]
        Window[WidgetsMainWindow]
        Viewport[OpenGLViewportWidget: plain QWidget]
        Provider[QtGraphicsContextProvider]
        Inspector[InspectorWidget]
        ObjectList[SceneObjectListWidget]
        Adapter[QTSceneInspector]
        Settings[QTEngineSettingsAdapter]
        Log[EngineLogWidget]
        Fields[Qt inspect field widgets]
        Stats[RenderStatisticsWidget]
        Styles[Theme styles]
    end

    subgraph Engine[engine DLL]
        Facade[Engine facade]
        EngineThread[Engine thread: input drain, Update, render, readback]
        Services[Locked inspection / settings services, log service]
    end

    Main --> Window
    Window --> Viewport
    Window --> Inspector
    Window --> ObjectList
    Window --> Stats
    Window --> Log
    Window --> Styles
    Window -. singleShot: StartEngine / closeEvent: ShutdownEngine .-> Viewport
    Viewport --> Provider
    Viewport --> Facade
    Provider -. context created / current on engine thread .-> EngineThread
    Facade --> EngineThread
    Viewport -. input, SetScreenSize .-> Facade
    EngineThread -. OnFrameReady, queued + coalesced .-> Viewport
    Viewport -. GetScreenFrame: top-down RGBA8 .-> Facade
    Viewport --> Adapter
    Viewport --> Settings
    Adapter --> Services
    Settings --> Services
    Log --> Services
    Services -. change callbacks, queued + coalesced .-> Adapter
    Services -. queued .-> Settings
    Services -. queued .-> Log
    Adapter --> Fields
    ObjectList --> Adapter
    Inspector --> Fields
    Fields -. edit callbacks .-> Adapter
    Adapter -. field setters .-> Services
